 <h3><u>Shehzada e qasim</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Alvida.. shehzada e qasim.. alvida...<br> Saji hui hai karbala jao tumhe allah ko saunpa<br> magar<br> ab kise keh ke bulaunga mai tasweer e hasan<br> alvida gul pairahan qasim e tashna dahan</p> 
  <p>1) Zainab e khasta jigar aur kulsoom e hazi'n<br> hoke masroof e buka ghash pe ghash khane lagi<br> roke kehti hai phuphi, ay mere shere jawan<br> izn de kyu na akhi, ay mere sher e jawan<br> tu sifarish ke liye laya jo taviz e hasan</p> 
  <p>2) Bhai shabbar ki mere ik nishani tum ho<br> kaise marne ke liye bhej du mai tumko<br> tumhi akbar ho mere, ay mere sher e jawan<br> tum hi lashkar ho mere, ay mere sher e jawan<br> sang is dil pe rakha phir ye kiye maine sukhan</p> 
  <p>3) De dia izn e wega thaam ke qalb o jigar<br> tum bhi ho jao juda aye mere noor e nazar<br> jao hafiz hai khuda, ay mere sher e jawan<br> roke sarwar ne kaha, ay mere sher e jawan<br> alvida tujhko kaha hone lagi dil me chubhan</p> 
  <p>4) Maa ke armaan hain kya ye nahi socha kabhi<br> kya hai behno ki dua ye nahi socha kabhi<br> tum jo marne ko chale, ay mere sher e jawan<br> zakhme dil gehre hue, ay mere sher e jawan<br> bewa lagne lagi ye kehte hi ik shab ki dulhan</p> 
  <p>5) Maar dalega mujhe teri furqat ka ye gham<br> tu suye dasht na ja tujhko sughra ki qasam<br> waqt ye kaisa pada, ay mere sher e jawan<br> jo ho manzoor e khuda, ay mere sher e jawan<br> dasht se launga gathri me tera tukde badan</p> 
  <p>6) Ban me jab jaoge tum ye to mujhko hai khabar<br> tan se kardoge juda arzaqe shami ka sar<br> hai magar ye bhi yaqeen, ay mere sher e jawan<br> tujhko gherenge layi'n, ay mere sher e jawan<br> haye ho jayega paamaal ye nazuk sa badan</p> 
  <p>7) Dasht e ghurbat me mujhe sab ke sab chod gaye<br> aur shahadat ke liye tum kamar basta hue<br> meri turbat ke liye, ay mere sher e jawan<br> char kandhe na rahe, ay mere sher e jawan<br> alvida tujhko kaha hone lagi dil me chubhan</p> 
  <p>8) Dekh maadar ki taraf kaise karti hai buka<br> aankh me dajlyae gham or honto pe sada<br> dekh mar jaye na maa, ay mere sher e jawan<br> kaise bheju mai wahan, ay mere sher e jawan<br> tu jahan jaane ko kehta hai wo hai maut ka ban</p> 
  <p>9) Roke mazhar ne kaha ye irfan e aaza<br> jab tasavvur me gaya mera dil kaanp utha<br> kaise maula ne kaha, ay mere sher e jawan<br> ja suye dasht e qaza, ay mere sher e jawan<br> aaj bhi rota hun jab honto pe aata hai sukhan</p> 
